# The `assets/` tree is not versioned here: models, textures, audio, fonts and
# video are large payloads, and the `*.manifest` files that describe them sit
# beside them and are authored/generated locally too. Copy both from the source
# distribution. Only docs (`*.md`) and text stay tracked, to describe the layout.
#
# This only filters *untracked* paths; already-committed assets stay tracked.
# To stop tracking a payload that is already committed: `git rm --cached <path>`.

# ── audio ──
*.wav
*.ogg
*.oga
*.mp3
*.flac
*.opus
*.aif
*.aiff
*.m4a
*.wma
*.mod
*.xm
*.s3m
*.it
*.mid
*.midi

# ── models ──
*.iqm
*.gltf
*.glb
*.fbx
*.obj
*.mtl
*.dae
*.blend
*.morphs
*.bin

# ── textures / images ──
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.tif
*.tiff
*.bmp
*.tga
*.dds
*.ktx
*.ktx2
*.webp
*.psd
*.exr
*.hdr
*.raw
*.cbm
*.cur

# ── fonts ──
*.ttf
*.otf
*.woff
*.woff2

# ── video ──
*.mp4
*.webm
*.mov

# ── asset metadata ──
*.manifest
# Intermediate morph metadata from tools/iqm_export_with_morphs.py. Convert it
# with tools/morphs_to_sugoi.py; the engine reads <name>.morphs + <name>.morphs.bin.
morphs.json

# ── keep docs ──
!*.md
!*.txt
